[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; UR-HUDS (pulp UI redesign, 2026-10-26): HUD-S1 corner cluster. Left column: three panels (VITALS
; and ABILITIES tagged, the time tools untagged) under the level title; right column: the dust plate
; and the Integrity dial; BossPanel is a plain Control laid out in code (top centre, BOSS-B).
; Every pre-redesign glyph Label (status, Defy, cooldown, rewind, freeze, dust) is kept with its Text
; and TooltipText for the tests and accessibility, its characters hidden, and the pulp widget is added
; in code as its child. Paths moved only by the new panel nesting (docs/handoffs/UR_HUDS.md).

